{
  "_comment": [
    "SDL-723: shared fixture — an Element migration reaching a Component's params. The engine test replays it through",
    "saunaMigrateComponent; the Go twin (pages-service, internal/document/testdata) replays it verbatim.",
    "`definitions`: Elements as element-catalog.json ships them ({type, propsVersion, migrations}); a node whose type is not",
    "listed (Stack, Ref) is left alone. Each case: `component` -> `expect_component` (nodes migrated to the definition's",
    "propsVersion, params[].prop following rename / one-segment move; a param whose prop is removed or moved into a nested",
    "path is dropped), `expect_removed_params` (names, in params order). `page` -> `expect_page`: the page referencing",
    "`block_id` is NOT rewritten (expect_page == page): Ref.props.params is keyed by param NAME, so a rename needs nothing,",
    "and a value whose param was removed stays as an orphan (SDL-501: never dropped silently; refParamOrphans reports it).",
    "Compare as JSON values (key order free)."
  ],
  "definitions": [
    {
      "type": "ParamProbe",
      "propsVersion": 3,
      "migrations": [
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "op": "rename",
              "from": "title",
              "to": "heading"
            },
            {
              "op": "remove",
              "key": "legacy"
            },
            {
              "op": "move",
              "from": "color",
              "to": "style.color"
            },
            {
              "op": "rename",
              "from": "style.align",
              "to": "justify"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "steps": [
            {
              "op": "rename",
              "from": "heading",
              "to": "headline"
            },
            {
              "op": "setDefault",
              "key": "size",
              "value": "m"
            },
            {
              "op": "mapValue",
              "key": "note",
              "map": {
                "old": "new"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
